OL,3,GNEWSAStolen rural equipment worth #120k
OL,4,Aseized by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have seized #120,000 worth of
OL,7,Fstolen rural vehicles and equipment as
OL,8,Fpart of an operation looking into
OL,9,Fagricultural machinery thefts across
OL,10,FKent.
OL,12,FTwo cars, two vans, two caravans and a
OL,13,Fhorse box were among the stolen
OL,14,Fproperty seized by Kent Police's Rural
OL,15,FTask Force, while two other cars were
OL,16,Ffound stripped entirely for parts,
OL,17,Fincluding a #40,000 Lexus.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
