OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStolen rural equipment worth #120k
OL,4,Aseized by police
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operation saw spot checks being
OL,7,Fcarried out at the Port of Dover, and
OL,8,Fofficers visiting rural areas of
OL,9,FAshford, Canterbury and Maidstone,
OL,10,Fpolice said.
OL,12,FSgt Ross Haybourne said: "[Thieves]
OL,13,Fshould not feel like they have got away
OL,14,Fwith it if they are not immediately
OL,15,Fdetected, because their crimes will
OL,16,Fcatch up with them in the end."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
